{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise. Conquer. Rule.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/148afdc750b6de68fee6315dae00fc4c.webp?t=1770107193\" width=616 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your army in a tactical, turn-based strategy game where every move matters. Battle across an 8x8 grid, blending classic chess-like mechanics with roguelike progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/8f3209edb97833afc873f60a7faac133.poster.avif?t=1770107193\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/8f3209edb97833afc873f60a7faac133.webm?t=1770107193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/8f3209edb97833afc873f60a7faac133.mp4?t=1770107193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/148afdc750b6de68fee6315dae00fc4c.webp?t=1770107193\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Campaign Mode</strong> \u2013 Start as an ambitious challenger, fight through escalating battles, and dethrone the reigning king in series of battles. <br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Face relentless waves of enemies, upgrading and recruiting new units as you fight for survival. Watch out as both you and enemies will get stronger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/148afdc750b6de68fee6315dae00fc4c.webp?t=1770107193\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/eacafd4d47d6411d2f9e2fbc10edceb5.poster.avif?t=1770107193\" width=688 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/eacafd4d47d6411d2f9e2fbc10edceb5.webm?t=1770107193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/eacafd4d47d6411d2f9e2fbc10edceb5.mp4?t=1770107193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grid-Based Battles</strong> \u2013 Position and maneuver your units wisely to outplay opponent.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Evolving Challenges</strong> \u2013 Each victory reshapes the battlefield with new obstacles and enemies.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Tactical Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Earn cards to power up your army and recruit unique units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>You are the king</strong> \u2013 By all means, protect the king! If the king is lost, the game is over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Your Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/148afdc750b6de68fee6315dae00fc4c.webp?t=1770107193\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/84d0409e249919f531c16c9a3bda4520.poster.avif?t=1770107193\" width=800 height=636 ><sou